      "status": "explicitly-disclosed-not-silently-corrected",
      "evidence": "Original n32 defines overline(v^2). Independent source solution gives about0.97%. Actual canonical bookRaw says about0.5%, numerically consistent with the different RMS increase about0.4825%; this is not proof of why the book differs. Final answers retain raw0.5%, use source=derived and explain the disagreement in notes. No original source, raw key or author artifact was edited.",
